  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Code Organization**\n\nI\'m now focusing on improving the codebase\'s structure. I think organizing the tools modularly will be the most effective approach. I\'m considering using `/src/tools/index.ts` to manage these modules, which would compile them neatly. I believe splitting tools into individual files is a good strategy.\n\n\n**Categorizing Tools for Clarity**\n\nI\'ve been working on categorizing the tools for better organization. Breaking them down into logical groups like PDF processing, image handling, direct vector printing, and utilities, seems like the most effective way to go. This approach will allow us to consolidate related functions into larger, more manageable files, preventing the code from exceeding any arbitrary line limits. This should greatly improve readability and maintainability.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 18
      nanos: 548154658
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
