  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Sophisticated Dark\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Sophisticated Dark\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-[#050505] text-[#d1d1d1] font-sans flex overflow-hidden border-8 border-[#1a1a1a]\\\">\\n  <!-- Sidebar Navigation -->\\n  <aside class=\\\"w-64 border-r border-white/5 bg-[#0a0a0a] flex flex-col\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"p-8\\\">\\n      <h1 class=\\\"text-2xl font-serif text-white tracking-tight italic\\\">HemiToolkit</h1>\\n      <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mt-1\\\">Developer Utility Suite</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav class=\\\"flex-1 px-4 space-y-1\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 bg-white/5 text-white rounded-lg\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500\\\"></div>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-sm font-medium\\\">Dashboard</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors cursor-pointer group\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-700 group-hover:bg-zinc-500\\\"></div>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-sm\\\">Code Utilities</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors cursor-pointer group\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-700 group-hover:bg-zinc-500\\\"></div>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-sm\\\">Network Tools</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors cursor-pointer group\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-700 group-hover:bg-zinc-500\\\"></div>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-sm\\\">Graphics & Design</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors cursor-pointer group\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-700 group-hover:bg-zinc-500\\\"></div>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-sm\\\">Settings</span>\\n      </div>\\n    </nav>\\n    <div class=\\\"p-6 mt-auto\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#111] to-[#050505] border border-white/5\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[11px] text-zinc-400\\\">System Uptime</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-lg font-mono text-white\\\">99.98%</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </aside>\\n\\n  <!-- Main Content Area -->\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col\\\">\\n    <!-- Header -->\\n    <header class=\\\"h-20 border-b border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between px-10 bg-[#050505]\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"relative\\\">\\n          <input type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Search for a tool...\\\" class=\\\"bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-full px-6 py-2 text-sm w-80 focus:outline-none focus:border-white/20\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"absolute right-4 top-2 text-xs text-zinc-600\\\">CMD + K</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-6\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500 animate-pulse\\\"></div>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-xs text-zinc-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-medium\\\">Server Live</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-zinc-800 to-zinc-700 border border-white/10\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <!-- Tool Grid -->\\n    <section class=\\\"flex-1 p-10 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-baseline justify-between mb-8\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"text-4xl font-serif text-white italic\\\">Toolkit Overview</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-sm text-zinc-500\\\">6 Active Services Available</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-6\\\">\\n        <!-- Card 1 -->\\n        <div class=\\\"group p-6 bg-[#0c0c0c] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl hover:border-white/20 transition-all cursor-pointer relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-20 h-20 bg-blue-500/10 blur-3xl rounded-full group-hover:bg-blue-500/20 transition-all\\\"></div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-blue-400 font-mono mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase\\\">Utility.01</p>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-medium text-white mb-2\\\">JSON Formatter</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed\\\">Beautify, minify, and validate JSON data instantly with one click.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Card 2 -->\\n        <div class=\\\"group p-6 bg-[#0c0c0c] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl hover:border-white/20 transition-all cursor-pointer relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-20 h-20 bg-purple-500/10 blur-3xl rounded-full group-hover:bg-purple-500/20 transition-all\\\"></div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-purple-400 font-mono mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase\\\">Security.02</p>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-medium text-white mb-2\\\">Secure Vault</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed\\\">Generate high-entropy passwords and hash strings using SHA-256.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Card 3 -->\\n        <div class=\\\"group p-6 bg-[#0c0c0c] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl hover:border-white/20 transition-all cursor-pointer relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-20 h-20 bg-emerald-500/10 blur-3xl rounded-full group-hover:bg-emerald-500/20 transition-all\\\"></div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-emerald-400 font-mono mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase\\\">Design.03</p>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-medium text-white mb-2\\\">Color Studio</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed\\\">Extract palettes, convert HEX/RGB/HSL, and check accessibility contrast.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Card 4 -->\\n        <div class=\\\"group p-6 bg-[#0c0c0c] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl hover:border-white/20 transition-all cursor-pointer relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-20 h-20 bg-orange-500/10 blur-3xl rounded-full group-hover:bg-orange-500/20 transition-all\\\"></div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-orange-400 font-mono mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase\\\">Network.04</p>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-medium text-white mb-2\\\">API Playground</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed\\\">Test REST endpoints with custom headers, payloads, and auth tokens.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Card 5 -->\\n        <div class=\\\"group p-6 bg-[#0c0c0c] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl hover:border-white/20 transition-all cursor-pointer relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-20 h-20 bg-amber-500/10 blur-3xl rounded-full group-hover:bg-amber-500/20 transition-all\\\"></div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-amber-400 font-mono mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase\\\">Convert.05</p>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-medium text-white mb-2\\\">Unit Converter</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed\\\">Comprehensive conversion for storage, bandwidth, and pixel-to-rem.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Card 6 -->\\n        <div class=\\\"group p-6 bg-[#0c0c0c] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl hover:border-white/20 transition-all cursor-pointer relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-20 h-20 bg-red-500/10 blur-3xl rounded-full group-hover:bg-red-500/20 transition-all\\\"></div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-red-400 font-mono mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase\\\">Editor.06</p>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-medium text-white mb-2\\\">MD Workspace</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed\\\">Draft technical documentation with live side-by-side Markdown preview.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Footer Status Bar -->\\n    <footer class=\\\"h-12 border-t border-white/5 px-10 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-zinc-600 bg-[#080808]\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex gap-6 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n        <span>Region: Global-NW</span>\\n        <span>Environment: Production</span>\\n        <span>User: hemanthnanu-tech</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"text-zinc-500\\\">v2.4.0-Stable</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/5 border border-white/10\\\">Documentation</span>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Sophisticated Dark\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Sophisticated Dark\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-[#050505] text-[#d1d1d1] font-sans flex overflow-hidden border-8 border-[#1a1a1a]\\\">\\n  <!-- Sidebar Navigation -->\\n  <aside class=\\\"w-64 border-r border-white/5 bg-[#0a0a0a] flex flex-col\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"p-8\\\">\\n      <h1 class=\\\"text-2xl font-serif text-white tracking-tight italic\\\">HemiToolkit</h1>\\n      <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mt-1\\\">Developer Utility Suite</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav class=\\\"flex-1 px-4 space-y-1\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 bg-white/5 text-white rounded-lg\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500\\\"></div>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-sm font-medium\\\">Dashboard</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors cursor-pointer group\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-700 group-hover:bg-zinc-500\\\"></div>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-sm\\\">Code Utilities</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors cursor-pointer group\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-700 group-hover:bg-zinc-500\\\"></div>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-sm\\\">Network Tools</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors cursor-pointer group\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-700 group-hover:bg-zinc-500\\\"></div>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-sm\\\">Graphics & Design</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors cursor-pointer group\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-700 group-hover:bg-zinc-500\\\"></div>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-sm\\\">Settings</span>\\n      </div>\\n    </nav>\\n    <div class=\\\"p-6 mt-auto\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#111] to-[#050505] border border-white/5\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[11px] text-zinc-400\\\">System Uptime</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-lg font-mono text-white\\\">99.98%</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </aside>\\n\\n  <!-- Main Content Area -->\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col\\\">\\n    <!-- Header -->\\n    <header class=\\\"h-20 border-b border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between px-10 bg-[#050505]\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"relative\\\">\\n          <input type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Search for a tool...\\\" class=\\\"bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-full px-6 py-2 text-sm w-80 focus:outline-none focus:border-white/20\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"absolute right-4 top-2 text-xs text-zinc-600\\\">CMD + K</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-6\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500 animate-pulse\\\"></div>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-xs text-zinc-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-medium\\\">Server Live</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-zinc-800 to-zinc-700 border border-white/10\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <!-- Tool Grid -->\\n    <section class=\\\"flex-1 p-10 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-baseline justify-between mb-8\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"text-4xl font-serif text-white italic\\\">Toolkit Overview</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-sm text-zinc-500\\\">6 Active Services Available</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-6\\\">\\n        <!-- Card 1 -->\\n        <div class=\\\"group p-6 bg-[#0c0c0c] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl hover:border-white/20 transition-all cursor-pointer relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-20 h-20 bg-blue-500/10 blur-3xl rounded-full group-hover:bg-blue-500/20 transition-all\\\"></div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-blue-400 font-mono mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase\\\">Utility.01</p>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-medium text-white mb-2\\\">JSON Formatter</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed\\\">Beautify, minify, and validate JSON data instantly with one click.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Card 2 -->\\n        <div class=\\\"group p-6 bg-[#0c0c0c] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl hover:border-white/20 transition-all cursor-pointer relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-20 h-20 bg-purple-500/10 blur-3xl rounded-full group-hover:bg-purple-500/20 transition-all\\\"></div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-purple-400 font-mono mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase\\\">Security.02</p>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-medium text-white mb-2\\\">Secure Vault</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed\\\">Generate high-entropy passwords and hash strings using SHA-256.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Card 3 -->\\n        <div class=\\\"group p-6 bg-[#0c0c0c] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl hover:border-white/20 transition-all cursor-pointer relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-20 h-20 bg-emerald-500/10 blur-3xl rounded-full group-hover:bg-emerald-500/20 transition-all\\\"></div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-emerald-400 font-mono mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase\\\">Design.03</p>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-medium text-white mb-2\\\">Color Studio</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed\\\">Extract palettes, convert HEX/RGB/HSL, and check accessibility contrast.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Card 4 -->\\n        <div class=\\\"group p-6 bg-[#0c0c0c] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl hover:border-white/20 transition-all cursor-pointer relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-20 h-20 bg-orange-500/10 blur-3xl rounded-full group-hover:bg-orange-500/20 transition-all\\\"></div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-orange-400 font-mono mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase\\\">Network.04</p>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-medium text-white mb-2\\\">API Playground</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed\\\">Test REST endpoints with custom headers, payloads, and auth tokens.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Card 5 -->\\n        <div class=\\\"group p-6 bg-[#0c0c0c] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl hover:border-white/20 transition-all cursor-pointer relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-20 h-20 bg-amber-500/10 blur-3xl rounded-full group-hover:bg-amber-500/20 transition-all\\\"></div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-amber-400 font-mono mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase\\\">Convert.05</p>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-medium text-white mb-2\\\">Unit Converter</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed\\\">Comprehensive conversion for storage, bandwidth, and pixel-to-rem.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Card 6 -->\\n        <div class=\\\"group p-6 bg-[#0c0c0c] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl hover:border-white/20 transition-all cursor-pointer relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-20 h-20 bg-red-500/10 blur-3xl rounded-full group-hover:bg-red-500/20 transition-all\\\"></div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-red-400 font-mono mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase\\\">Editor.06</p>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-medium text-white mb-2\\\">MD Workspace</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed\\\">Draft technical documentation with live side-by-side Markdown preview.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Footer Status Bar -->\\n    <footer class=\\\"h-12 border-t border-white/5 px-10 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-zinc-600 bg-[#080808]\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex gap-6 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n        <span>Region: Global-NW</span>\\n        <span>Environment: Production</span>\\n        <span>User: hemanthnanu-tech</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"text-zinc-500\\\">v2.4.0-Stable</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/5 border border-white/10\\\">Documentation</span>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
