    modified_response: "I have completed the final visual polish and user experience enhancements for the application, aligning all tools and interactions perfectly with the **Sophisticated Dark** aesthetic.\n\n### Aesthetic & Functional Enhancements\n\n- **Ambient Backdrop Mesh Aura**: Injected an ambient radial lighting mesh in the background (`body::before`) that creates a subtle, glowing studio depth. This is highly optimized, eye-safe, and dynamically adapts across theme modes (Soft Off-White in Light mode, Cosmic Deep Blue in Dark/OLED modes) with zero DOM pollution.\n- **Global Drag & Drop Infrastructure**: Added a state-of-the-art global drop-zone file interceptor in the routing layer. Any tool containing file inputs (such as PDF editors, image compressors, converters, etc.) now instantly supports rich drag-and-drop actions. Files dropped on `#drop-zone` components trigger a glowing pulsing scale border transition, seamlessly feeding files directly into the active tool\'s processor.\n- **Cohesive SweetAlert Custom Styling**: Fully redesigned and themed the browser popups, alerts, and loaders. Standard SweetAlert overlays have been replaced with elegant glass-morphism panels, soft borders, and premium high-contrast buttons, keeping the alert interface entirely native to the suite.\n- **Micro-interactions & Directional Transitions**: \n  - Buttons like **Back to Dashboard** now slide their chevron icons smoothly to the left on hover.\n  - Category filter pills are framed with custom thin outlines and subtle scales to make state switching feel exceptionally soft and fluid.\n  - Active tool cards are enhanced with dynamic glow spots, 3D mouse tilt tracking, and overlay card glares."
