  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have resolved the styling issue and fixed the CSS rendering bug.\n\n### Root Cause Analysis & Fix:\n- **Missing stylesheet connection**: The `index.css` file containing all the custom styling declarations and Tailwind directives was not being imported or linked. As a result, the browser rendered unstyled, raw HTML templates.\n- **The Solution**: \n  - Imported `index.css` at the very top of `src/main.ts` so Vite compiles and bundles custom Tailwind variables and typography perfectly.\n  - Added a `<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/src/index.css\">` reference directly to the `<head>` of `index.html` to prevent any visual flicker on initial page load (FOUC).\n\n### Visual Polish & Upgrades:\n- **Clean Ambient Glows**: Implemented smooth radial-glow backgrounds on the main stage to give a deep, modern three-dimensional aspect.\n- **Interactive Feedback**: Designed active drag-over state classes to offer clean, pulsing visual responses across the workspace drop-zones.\n- **Customized Modal Alerts**: Fully customized the SweetAlert containers with polished typography, background blur patterns, and subtle transitions to complement the *Sophisticated Dark* theme perfectly."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
