    thinking: "**Celebrating Code Completion**\n\nMy code is finally running cleanly! I\'ve squashed all the bugs, and the linter is happy. I also removed that pesky \"Server Live\" text and made the SweetAlert match the UI. It\'s a satisfying result!\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have successfully resolved all visual bugs, resolved colors, corrected the hover behavior, and polished the tool suite.\n\n### Summary of Improvements Introduced:\n\n*   **Responsive Color Palette & Real-Time Contrast Fix**:\n    *   Replaced hardcoded static lighter text styles (`text-white`, `text-zinc-400`, `text-gray-xyz`) with dynamic **semantic variables** (`text-[var(--text-primary)]`, `text-[var(--text-secondary)]`, etc.). This guarantees perfect readability and strong contrast against the workspace\'s soft cream background in **Light mode**, coal backgrounds in **Dark mode**, and deep obsidian pitches in the **OLED theme**.\n    *   Harmonized the search workspace element, theme toggle buttons, and category buttons with theme-aware bounds.\n\n*   **Stable Flat-Grid Interaction (Disabled Hover Bending)**:\n    *   Removed physical tilt, rotate, and scale transforms from the bento cards by removing the `transform-style: preserve-3d;` and `will-change: transform;` properties from `.tool-card`.\n    *   Simplified the mouse interactions in `src/main.ts` so that hovering no longer bends or twists the element, resulting in a cleaner and modern flat response while preserving a subtle ambient glare spot tracking movement.\n\n*   **Removed Developer Status Indicators**:\n    *   Completely eliminated the redundant **\"Server Live\"** status badge from the header area to restore a clean space-conserving aesthetic.\n\n*   **Pristine Visuals & Custom Overlays**:\n    *   Integrated customized typography, backing colors, and action borders for alert modals using semantic theme parameters for professional-grade consistency.\n"
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 106137554
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
